raft.com/tutorials"},{"DocumentLabel":"常见问题","DocumentUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/faq"}],"locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"动态图形与视觉特效；一个以纯 Rust 全新重写的开源 Adobe After Effects 净室重实现。\nEffectCraft 尚处早期：首次提交于 2026 年 10 月 1 日。After Effects 的几乎所有功能均已具备，包括其全部效果，但“存在”并不等于表现与 After Effects 完全一致。现在它是尝试新事物、并告诉我们哪里出问题的好地方。\nAfter Effects 项目尚无法打开。项目会保存为 .ecproj（可读的版本化 JSON），EffectCraft 无法打开 .aep / .aepx 文件，After Effects 插件也无法运行。","tags":["动画","特效"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/support","publisherUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/","releaseDate":"2026-11-07","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/storytold/effectcraft/releases/tag/v0.22.0","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"744664bad9c815e008fd4699b4c420d0afcd488f","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/a/ArtCraft/EffectCraft/0.22.0/ArtCraft.EffectCraft.installer.yaml","sha256":"dfb1904d9ef7da488ce33da5d7cd8a4599ec1861e5f77c0f83e86a009b768f55"},{"path":"manifests/a/ArtCraft/EffectCraft/0.22.0/ArtCraft.EffectCraft.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"40851ee28fa438ff9eff2620cb04ea11996ce9c667cc5bd9db729af2524f4eb0"},{"path":"manifests/a/ArtCraft/EffectCraft/0.22.0/ArtCraft.EffectCraft.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"e6b5a5d3fcef7ea502f9e40e9e75e37701b79ff82230bb45e2d72dc9989264db"},{"path":"manifests/a/ArtCraft/EffectCraft/0.22.0/ArtCraft.EffectCraft.yaml","sha256":"8fe9151ea10f8918460cd6204f41885fd38bfbd29e7e7c2585ba16a1aa03203e"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.22.0"}